{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01fLyHAmJnf50JioaQyv6vLt","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"5:2\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"2852\">\n    <frame id=\"5:3\" name=\"Header\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1312\" height=\"145\">\n      <text id=\"5:4\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"182\" height=\"19\" />\n      <text id=\"5:5\" name=\"Payment Wallet — pay, manage, grow\" x=\"0\" y=\"31\" width=\"1312\" height=\"52\" />\n      <text id=\"5:6\" name=\"Design a mobile payment wallet: onboard, start with a phone number, see your bank balances and recent transactions, and reach the main areas from the side menu. Canvas 390 × 844, iPhone. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"95\" width=\"1312\" height=\"50\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:7\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"64\" y=\"257\" width=\"1312\" height=\"227\">\n      <text id=\"5:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"147\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"5:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 4 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator, system numeric keypad). Design all other states, the headers, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the illustration, avatars, bank and merchant marks and icons from 04 · Media. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"176\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:10\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"64\" y=\"532\" width=\"1312\" height=\"805\">\n      <text id=\"5:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"413\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"5:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"5:13\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"716\">\n        <frame id=\"5:14\" name=\"01_Onboarding\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"276\">\n          <text id=\"5:15\" name=\"01_Onboarding\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"134\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"5:16\" name=\"Goal: Understand the app and choose to start.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"5:18\" name=\"• Actions: “Get Started” · “Sign in” • Copy: “Pay / Manage / Grow…” (one word per line) · “An easy app to manage all your payment and finance-related needs” · “Already have an account?” • Media: Illustration_Onboarding\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"80\" />\n          <text id=\"5:19\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"206\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"5:20\" name=\"→ Get Started → 02_Phone_Number\" x=\"24\" y=\"232\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:21\" name=\"02_Phone_Number\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"316\">\n          <text id=\"5:22\" name=\"02_Phone_Number\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"168\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"5:23\" name=\"Goal: Enter a phone number to get started.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:24\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"5:25\" name=\"• Actions: “Cancel” · “Get Started” • Form: “Phone Number” · country code +91 · empty (placeholder 9812345678) · focused • Header: “Get Started” · “Please enter the mobile phone number” • Keyboard: system numeric keypad open (Numeric Keypad) • Presentation: sheet over 01_Onboarding\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"100\" />\n          <text id=\"5:26\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"226\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"5:27\" name=\"→ Get Started → 03_Home → Cancel → 01_Onboarding\" x=\"24\" y=\"252\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:28\" name=\"03_Home\" x=\"0\" y=\"340\" width=\"644\" height=\"376\">\n          <text id=\"5:29\" name=\"03_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"85\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"5:30\" name=\"Goal: Check my balances, move money and see recent transactions.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:31\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"5:32\" name=\"• Accounts: Axis Bank · HDFC Bank · Deutsche Bank · Union Bank, each with its mark and balance (see DATA) • Actions: “Send” (Icon_Send) · “Receive” (Icon_Receive) · refresh balance (Icon_Refresh) · “Transaction History” · “Scan any QR” (Icon_Scan) • Balance: Bank_HSBC · “Last Updated Balance” · ₹85,625 · “Primary” (Icon_Check_Badge) • Header: Avatar_Hallie_Goebel (opens the menu) · search “Pay by name or phone” (Icon_Search) · history (Icon_History) • Offer: “Invite friends and get ₹1,000 reward” (Icon_Offer) • Transactions: “RECENT TRANSACTIONS” · 3 rows (see DATA)\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"180\" />\n          <text id=\"5:33\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"306\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"5:34\" name=\"→ avatar → 04_Menu\" x=\"24\" y=\"332\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:35\" name=\"04_Menu\" x=\"668\" y=\"340\" width=\"644\" height=\"316\">\n          <text id=\"5:36\" name=\"04_Menu\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"83\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"5:37\" name=\"Goal: Reach the main areas of the app.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:38\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"5:39\" name=\"• Account: Avatar_Hallie_Goebel · “Hallie Goebel” · hallie.goebel@example.com • Actions: “Logout” (Icon_Logout) • Menu: New Payment (Icon_New_Payment) · Bank Accounts (Icon_Bank) · All Transactions (Icon_History) · Rewards &amp; Offers (Icon_Offer) · Settings (Icon_Settings) — source order • Presentation: side menu over 03_Home, with 03_Home still partly visible\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"120\" />\n          <text id=\"5:40\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"246\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"5:41\" name=\"→ tap the visible part of 03_Home → 03_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"272\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:42\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"64\" y=\"1385\" width=\"1312\" height=\"117\">\n      <text id=\"5:43\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"242\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"5:44\" name=\"• Onboarding: 01_Onboarding → Get Started → 02_Phone_Number (sheet over 01) → Get Started → 03_Home; Cancel → 01. • 04_Menu is a side menu opened from the avatar on 03_Home. There is no tab bar in this task. • Entry only (no frame): Sign in, search, history, refresh, account tiles, Send, Receive, reward banner, transaction rows, Transaction History, Scan any QR, menu rows, Logout.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"66\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:45\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"64\" y=\"1550\" width=\"1312\" height=\"569\">\n      <text id=\"5:46\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"207\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"5:47\" name=\"Use these values verbatim.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"5:48\" name=\"Data blocks\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"480\">\n        <frame id=\"5:49\" name=\"User\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"106\">\n          <text id=\"5:50\" name=\"User\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"33\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:51\" name=\"Hallie Goebel · hallie.goebel@example.com · Avatar_Hallie_Goebel\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"38\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:52\" name=\"Primary account\" x=\"444\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"87\">\n          <text id=\"5:53\" name=\"Primary account\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"113\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:54\" name=\"HSBC (Bank_HSBC) · Last Updated Balance ₹85,625 · Primary\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"19\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:55\" name=\"Other accounts (source order)\" x=\"888\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"144\">\n          <text id=\"5:56\" name=\"Other accounts (source order)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"209\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:57\" name=\"Axis Bank ₹3,500 (Bank_Axis) HDFC Bank ₹63,520 (Bank_HDFC) Deutsche Bank ₹36,258 (Bank_Deutsche) Union Bank ₹67,820 (Bank_Union)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"76\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:58\" name=\"Recent transactions (newest first)\" x=\"0\" y=\"168\" width=\"420\" height=\"182\">\n          <text id=\"5:59\" name=\"Recent transactions (newest first)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"235\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:60\" name=\"Paytm Auto Pay · 22 Jan · Weekly transaction · −₹3,500 (Merchant_Paytm) Risa Midyett · 05 Jan · Gift for Christmas · +₹6,950 (Avatar_Risa_Midyett) Amazon Pantry · 01 Jan · Subscription payment · −₹1,200 (Merchant_Amazon)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"114\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:61\" name=\"Reward\" x=\"444\" y=\"168\" width=\"420\" height=\"87\">\n          <text id=\"5:62\" name=\"Reward\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"52\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:63\" name=\"Invite friends and get ₹1,000 reward\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"19\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:64\" name=\"Phone sign-up\" x=\"888\" y=\"168\" width=\"420\" height=\"87\">\n          <text id=\"5:65\" name=\"Phone sign-up\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"101\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:66\" name=\"Country code +91 · field empty, placeholder 9812345678\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"19\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:67\" name=\"Menu (source order)\" x=\"0\" y=\"374\" width=\"420\" height=\"106\">\n          <text id=\"5:68\" name=\"Menu (source order)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"141\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:69\" name=\"New Payment · Bank Accounts · All Transactions · Rewards &amp; Offers · Settings · Logout\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"38\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:70\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"64\" y=\"2167\" width=\"1312\" height=\"292\">\n      <text id=\"5:71\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"328\" height=\"35\" />\n      <frame id=\"5:72\" name=\"Fixed vs yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"241\">\n        <frame id=\"5:73\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"221\">\n          <text id=\"5:74\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"103\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"5:75\" name=\"• Frame list and exact names • Must-include content per frame (what, not how) • Navigation structure and links • All data and copy • Brand color #1E32FA and Inter • Media: illustration, avatars, bank and merchant marks, icons • Default Button, default Text Field, platform shell incl. numeric keypad\" x=\"24\" y=\"57\" width=\"596\" height=\"140\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:76\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"241\">\n          <text id=\"5:77\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"197\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"5:78\" name=\"• Layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen • All other colors: neutrals, text, backgrounds / surfaces, Send / Receive, positive / negative amounts, reward banner, error / disabled • Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation • All states: focused field, primary account, pressed, disabled • Headers, sheet, balance block, account tiles, actions, banner, transaction rows, scan button, side menu • How the illustration and photos are cropped and treated\" x=\"24\" y=\"57\" width=\"596\" height=\"160\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:79\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"64\" y=\"2507\" width=\"1312\" height=\"281\">\n      <text id=\"5:80\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"222\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"5:81\" name=\"Your file is compared with this brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any original.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <text id=\"5:82\" name=\"1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data &amp; copy accuracy 3. Flow &amp; prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality &amp; consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (focused phone field with keypad, primary account, sheet and side-menu presentation)\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"154\" />\n      <text id=\"5:83\" name=\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 4 named frames, your components and the prototype.\" x=\"0\" y=\"259\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n    </frame>\n  </frame>\n</canvas>"},{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: After you call this tool, you MUST call get_design_context if trying to implement the design, since this tool only returns metadata. If you do not call get_design_context, the agent will not be able to implement the design."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"359b0325-1852-491e-a496-b61dcab9b9f5","uuid":"f1af7e31-9a50-471a-81ca-d6f1b364cb02","timestamp":"2026-11-02T08:17:57.721Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"5:2\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"2852\">\n    <frame id=\"5:3\" name=\"Header\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1312\" height=\"145\">\n      <text id=\"5:4\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"182\" height=\"19\" />\n      <text id=\"5:5\" name=\"Payment Wallet — pay, manage, grow\" x=\"0\" y=\"31\" width=\"1312\" height=\"52\" />\n      <text id=\"5:6\" name=\"Design a mobile payment wallet: onboard, start with a phone number, see your bank balances and recent transactions, and reach the main areas from the side menu. Canvas 390 × 844, iPhone. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"95\" width=\"1312\" height=\"50\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:7\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"64\" y=\"257\" width=\"1312\" height=\"227\">\n      <text id=\"5:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"147\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"5:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 4 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator, system numeric keypad). Design all other states, the headers, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the illustration, avatars, bank and merchant marks and icons from 04 · Media. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"176\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:10\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"64\" y=\"532\" width=\"1312\" height=\"805\">\n      <text id=\"5:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"413\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"5:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"5:13\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"716\">\n        <frame id=\"5:14\" name=\"01_Onboarding\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"276\">\n          <text id=\"5:15\" name=\"01_Onboarding\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"134\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"5:16\" name=\"Goal: Understand the app and choose to start.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"5:18\" name=\"• Actions: “Get Started” · “Sign in” • Copy: “Pay / Manage / Grow…” (one word per line) · “An easy app to manage all your payment and finance-related needs” · “Already have an account?” • Media: Illustration_Onboarding\" x=\"24\"