ransaction History” · “Scan any QR” (Icon_Scan) • Balance: Bank_HSBC · “Last Updated Balance” · ₹85,625 · “Primary” (Icon_Check_Badge) • Header: Avatar_Hallie_Goebel (opens the menu) · search “Pay by name or phone” (Icon_Search) · history (Icon_History) • Offer: “Invite friends and get ₹1,000 reward” (Icon_Offer) • Transactions: “RECENT TRANSACTIONS” · 3 rows (see DATA)\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"180\" />\n          <text id=\"5:33\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"306\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"5:34\" name=\"→ avatar → 04_Menu\" x=\"24\" y=\"332\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:35\" name=\"04_Menu\" x=\"668\" y=\"340\" width=\"644\" height=\"316\">\n          <text id=\"5:36\" name=\"04_Menu\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"83\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"5:37\" name=\"Goal: Reach the main areas of the app.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"5:38\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"5:39\" name=\"• Account: Avatar_Hallie_Goebel · “Hallie Goebel” · hallie.goebel@example.com • Actions: “Logout” (Icon_Logout) • Menu: New Payment (Icon_New_Payment) · Bank Accounts (Icon_Bank) · All Transactions (Icon_History) · Rewards &amp; Offers (Icon_Offer) · Settings (Icon_Settings) — source order • Presentation: side menu over 03_Home, with 03_Home still partly visible\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"120\" />\n          <text id=\"5:40\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"246\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"5:41\" name=\"→ tap the visible part of 03_Home → 03_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"272\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:42\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"64\" y=\"1385\" width=\"1312\" height=\"117\">\n      <text id=\"5:43\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"242\" height=\"35\" />\n      <